pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: ring
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [800, 360, 240, 240]
    shapeName: donut
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
    opacity: 0.25
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 52, 500, 14]
    content:
      style: "$kick"
      wrap: false
      text: 10 / 下一步 NEXT
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 88, 700, 36]
    content:
      style: "$h2"
      wrap: false
      text: 从一条成片，到一个设备生态。
  - elementId: r1-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 172, 80, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: Liter
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: NEAR
  - elementId: r1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 168, 300, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 接入影石设备生态
  - elementId: r1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [460, 168, 444, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: SDK 适配接口已预留；全景素材导出为普通视角视频后即可进入分析，来源全程可溯。
  - elementId: r-line-1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 228, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [848, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 848,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: r2-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 262, 80, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: Liter
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: MID
  - elementId: r2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 258, 300, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 用验收数据校准建议
  - elementId: r2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [460, 258, 444, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: 积累补拍与 AI 片段的真实验收结果，让「拍到什么算通过」越来越准。
  - elementId: r-line-2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 318, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [848, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 848,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: r3-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 352, 80, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: Liter
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: FAR
  - elementId: r3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 348, 300, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 把诊断移到拍摄之前
  - elementId: r3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [460, 348, 444, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: 从事后补拍走向现场提示：让第一遍就拍对，补拍清单越来越短。
  - elementId: r-line-3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 408, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [848, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 848,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: foot-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 500, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [848, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 848,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: foot-l
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 508, 400, 12]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      wrap: false
      text: 旭光集 LUMENARRATIVE
  - elementId: foot-r
    elementType: text
    bounds: [504, 508, 400, 12]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 11 / 12
